---
/**
 * Homepage「本站怎么核验」proof strip.
 * Chips are published Lab labeling facts, not user praise.
 * External quotes stay an empty slot until a verified public link is pasted in.
 */
---

<section class="proof-strip panel" id="how-we-verify" aria-labelledby="proof-strip-title">
  <div class="proof-strip-head">
    <h2 id="proof-strip-title" class="proof-strip-h2">本站怎么核验</h2>
    <p class="feed-sub proof-strip-sub">
      先看我们怎么标，再刷用例。How we label — before you skim the feed.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ul class="proof-chips" role="list">
    <li><span class="proof-chip">匿名探针</span><span class="proof-chip-hint">能连就标 HTTP／version／tools；连不上就写未实测</span></li>
    <li><span class="proof-chip">出处可点</span><span class="proof-chip-hint">数字跟公开页或 Lab 探针记录走</span></li>
    <li><span class="proof-chip">不编 UV</span><span class="proof-chip-hint">流量未稳不报虚荣访问量</span></li>
    <li><span class="proof-chip">Sponsored 另标</span><span class="proof-chip-hint">付费推广位与自然排序分开</span></li>
  </ul>

  <p class="muted-note proof-strip-example">
    例：FreightUtils 用例 —
    <a href="/cases/freightutils-freight-mcp-cited-tools/">匿名 initialize／tools/list HTTP 200 · v2.22.5 · 25 tools</a>
    （2026-10-26 Asia/Shanghai）。这是产品探针芯片，不是用户好评。
  </p>

  <!--
    外部引用：默认空槽。仅在核验「公开原文 + 可点链接」后，
    把注释示例改成真实 <li><a href="…">…</a></li>。
    禁止编造推文墙。若仍为空，保留「待填」标题。
  -->
  <div class="proof-ext">
    <h3 class="proof-ext-title">待填：外部引用 <span class="en">External quotes (verified only)</span></h3>
    <p class="muted-note">
      只贴已核验的公开评价／引用，并带原文链接。没有就留空——宁缺毋假。
      Paste verified public quotes with source links only. Empty is fine.
    </p>
    <ul class="proof-ext-list" role="list"><!-- SLOT 1: <li><a href="https://x.com/…" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@handle — 一句原话或忠实转述</a></li> --><!-- SLOT 2: <li><a href="https://…" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">来源标题 — 一句</a></li> --><!-- SLOT 3: optional third --></ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .proof-strip {
    margin: 1rem 1rem 1rem;
    padding: 1rem 1rem 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line, #d4d4d4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 0.5rem);
    background: var(--signal-panel, #eef4fb);
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .proof-strip { margin-inline: 1.5rem; padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem 1rem; }
  }
  .proof-strip-h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text, #000);
  }
  .proof-strip-sub { margin: 0.2rem 0 0; }
  .proof-chips {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0.85rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .proof-chips > li {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.15rem;
    flex: 1 1 calc(50% - 0.5rem);
    min-width: 9.5rem;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.65rem;
    background: var(--bg, #fff);
    border: 1px solid var(--line, #d4d4d4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 0.375rem);
  }
  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .proof-chips > li { flex: 1 1 calc(25% - 0.5rem); }
  }
  .proof-chip {
    font-family: var(--mono, ui-monospace, monospace);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--text, #000);
  }
  .proof-chip-hint {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--muted, #525252);
  }
  .proof-strip-example { margin-top: 0.75rem; }
  .proof-ext {
    margin-top: 0.9rem;
    padding-top: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--line, #d4d4d4);
  }
  .proof-ext-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text, #000);
  }
  .proof-ext-title .en {
    display: inline;
    margin-left: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--faint, #6b6b6b);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .proof-ext-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    min-height: 0.25rem;
  }
  .proof-ext-list:empty::after {
    content: "（暂无已核验外部引用 — 槽位空着）";
    display: block;
    color: var(--faint, #6b6b6b);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
  }
  .proof-ext-list li {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--muted, #525252);
  }
  .proof-ext-list a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
</style>
